			)
			(property "Description" "CEC 3-pin firmware-switched fan header (JST-PH B3B-PH-K-S vertical). Pin1 FAN_RET (switched GND return via Q_FAN low-side NMOS, default-on -- firmware drives the gate LOW to turn the fan off), pin2 +12V (FAN_12V, pre-shunt lane-6 tap, unswitched -- never counted in any per-pin GPU-side current measurement), pin3 TACH (open-collector tach, pulled up to +3V3). Owner-ratified fan-control leg, 2026-07-10/11; supersedes the DNP position-only 2-pin J2 provision (beta-lock-register J-menu item 2)."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
				(hide yes)
				(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
			)
