		(property "Note" "Q_FAN: low-side NMOS switch for J2 fan return. Drain=FAN_RET, Source=GND, Gate=FAN_GATE (100R series R14 from ESP32 IO21/FAN_EN, 10k pullup R15 to +3V3). DEFAULT-ON (owner ruling): with 3V3 up and the GPIO not actively driving low, R15 holds the gate high and the fan runs; firmware drives FAN_EN LOW to turn the fan off. 30V/5.7A SOT-23, LCSC C20917, 853k+ in stock." (at 149.86 49.53 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
